# GSuite: email|password  (or email:password)
# One account per line. # comments ok.

# user@your-gsuite.com|YourPassword

# --- register mode (--mode register) ---
# Create fresh accounts via email + IMAP OTP; no accounts file needed:
#   python -m qoder_farm --mode register --count 5 \
#     --email-source yourdomain.com --register-password 'Passw0rd!' --json-progress
# Or re-drive signup for specific emails (email|password lines above) with:
#   python -m qoder_farm --mode register -f accounts.txt
# Requires QODER_IMAP_HOST/USER/PASS in .env to read the verification code.
